AB  - Southern Cross Healthcare has implemented an electronic fluid balance record system across 13 hospitals to enhance patient care. The system allows real-time bedside recording and automatic calculation of fluid balance, reducing errors and improving clinical response times. The initiative is part of a broader digital transformation, including migrating patient records to AWS and co-designing mobile health solutions with Orion Health.
KW  - Electronic fluid balance record, digital transformation, patient care, real-time data, AWS migration, Orion Health, Southern Cross Healthcare
